  "alignment_method": "Transcription tokens (Chinese characters or ASCII alphanumeric runs) sequentially paired with FunASR raw_timestamp; split on punctuation. Millisecond times are model estimates.",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "如何一眼就能够认出这个人是不是高能量的人？",
      "token_start": 0,
      "token_end_exclusive": 20
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 3430,
      "end_ms": 5430,
      "text": "你看他怎么发朋友圈就对了，",
      "token_start": 20,
      "token_end_exclusive": 32
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 5930,
      "end_ms": 6630,
      "text": "记录生活，",
      "token_start": 32,
      "token_end_exclusive": 36
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 7390,
      "text": "发朋友圈，",
      "token_start": 36,
      "token_end_exclusive": 40
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7650,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "完全不在意别人的眼光和评价，",
      "token_start": 40,
      "token_end_exclusive": 53
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 9830,
      "end_ms": 10630,
      "text": "想拍就拍，",
      "token_start": 53,
      "token_end_exclusive": 57
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 10830,
      "end_ms": 12470,
      "text": "想怎么发就怎么发。",
      "token_start": 57,
      "token_end_exclusive": 65
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12690,
      "end_ms": 15950,
      "text": "那么这个人多半是灵魂自带高能量的人。",
      "token_start": 65,
      "token_end_exclusive": 82
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16430,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "那有人就说了，",
      "token_start": 82,
      "token_end_exclusive": 88
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 17630,
      "end_ms": 20370,
      "text": "那么发的多了会不会显得自己很幼稚？",
      "token_start": 88,
      "token_end_exclusive": 104
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 20970,
      "end_ms": 24410,
      "text": "其实啊活在成熟套路里的人才叫可悲。",
      "token_start": 104,
      "token_end_exclusive": 120
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 26610,
      "text": "高能量的人内心敞亮，",
      "token_start": 120,
      "token_end_exclusive": 129
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 26610,
      "end_ms": 27570,
      "text": "活的自在，",
      "token_start": 129,
      "token_end_exclusive": 133
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 27570,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "充满少年气。",
      "token_start": 133,
      "token_end_exclusive": 138
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 28890,
      "end_ms": 31240,
      "text": "那们从来都是都不在意别人的眼光。",
      "token_start": 138,
      "token_end_exclusive": 153
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 31560,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "发朋友圈，",
      "token_start": 153,
      "token_end_exclusive": 157
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 32620,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "其实也是纯粹因为热爱生活。",
      "token_start": 157,
      "token_end_exclusive": 169
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "那么有人又说了，",
      "token_start": 169,
      "token_end_exclusive": 176
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 37100,
      "end_ms": 40940,
      "text": "成年人的世界做人做事还是低调一些吧。",
      "token_start": 176,
      "token_end_exclusive": 193
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 41480,
      "end_ms": 42860,
      "text": "这是对低调的误解，",
      "token_start": 193,
      "token_end_exclusive": 201
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 43220,
      "end_ms": 44180,
      "text": "那叫枯萎。",
      "token_start": 201,
      "token_end_exclusive": 205
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 44720,
      "end_ms": 46080,
      "text": "真正活明白的人啊，",
      "token_start": 205,
      "token_end_exclusive": 213
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 46220,
      "end_ms": 47220,
      "text": "既会保留童心，",
      "token_start": 213,
      "token_end_exclusive": 219
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 48780,
      "text": "又懂得经营人生，",
      "token_start": 219,
      "token_end_exclusive": 226
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 49180,
      "end_ms": 50940,
      "text": "知世故而不世故，",
      "token_start": 226,
      "token_end_exclusive": 233
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 53100,
      "text": "利圆滑而留天真。",
      "token_start": 233,
      "token_end_exclusive": 240
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 53680,
      "end_ms": 54840,
      "text": "他们发朋友圈啊，",
      "token_start": 240,
      "token_end_exclusive": 247
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 54840,
      "end_ms": 56260,
      "text": "也绝不是为了炫耀，",
      "token_start": 247,
      "token_end_exclusive": 255
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 56560,
      "end_ms": 59080,
      "text": "而是为了记录生活记录成长。",
      "token_start": 255,
      "token_end_exclusive": 267
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 59440,
      "end_ms": 61010,
      "text": "因为当有一天你老了，",
      "token_start": 267,
      "token_end_exclusive": 276
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 61190,
      "end_ms": 62470,
      "text": "光翻看这些朋友圈，",
      "token_start": 276,
      "token_end_exclusive": 284
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62730,
      "end_ms": 64485,
      "text": "也够自己开心几十年。",
      "token_start": 284,
      "token_end_exclusive": 293
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 64870,
      "end_ms": 66190,
      "text": "这样的人啊好相处，",
      "token_start": 293,
      "token_end_exclusive": 301
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 66390,
      "end_ms": 67090,
      "text": "不拧巴，",
      "token_start": 301,
      "token_end_exclusive": 304
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 67310,
      "end_ms": 68085,
      "text": "不算计，",
      "token_start": 304,
      "token_end_exclusive": 307
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 68380,
      "end_ms": 69780,
      "text": "生活中受欢迎。",
      "token_start": 307,
      "token_end_exclusive": 313
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 69980,
      "end_ms": 71985,
      "text": "生意场上还自带流量，",
      "token_start": 313,
      "token_end_exclusive": 322
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 72230,
      "end_ms": 72825,
      "text": "做朋友，",
      "token_start": 322,
      "token_end_exclusive": 325
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 73090,
      "end_ms": 74435,
      "text": "也不会轻易背叛。",
      "token_start": 325,
      "token_end_exclusive": 332
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 74910,
      "end_ms": 77705,
      "text": "因为他们的内心是无惧的、自在的，",
      "token_start": 332,
      "token_end_exclusive": 346
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 78010,
      "end_ms": 80255,
      "text": "也是充满正能量的。",
      "token_start": 346,
      "token_end_exclusive": 354
    }
  ],
